    "Scan of the 1989 edition of the Ravenna, Montana, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1984; field checked in 1985; last revised in 1989; printed in 1989.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
